  "releaseNotes": "v0.12.0. New: none. Improvements: none. Fixes: single customer, product, and vendor invoice attachment downloads have a circuit breaker of their own, so they no longer trip the breaker every other call to the endpoint shares. A file DK Plus refuses with HTTP 400 or 500 makes one request and throws DkPlusRequestException with that status, and is not counted as a failure; timeouts, 429, 502, 503, 504, and connection failures still retry and open the attachment circuit only. Other operations keep the same breaker and behaviour.",
